<title>HUNGARY: CESI index dips to finish at 1,501.53 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index dips to finish at 1,501.53 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased on Tuesday to end at 1,501.53 points, down 4.20 points or 0.28 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
